zhhnw_name":"Nas\u0131l haz\u0131rlan\u0131r?","lh_ezhhnw_content_html":"Sa\u015fe i\u00e7eri\u011fini bir bardak suya d\u00f6k\u00fcn, h\u0131zl\u0131ca kar\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131p hemen i\u00e7in. Ard\u0131ndan 1 bardak su daha i\u00e7in. B\u00f6ylece etkisi artar.<!--lh-live-editor-->","lh_ezmuln_name":"A\u00e7 karna m\u0131, tok karna m\u0131 kullan\u0131lmal\u0131?","lh_ezmuln_content_html":"A\u00e7 karna yani yemeklerden 30 dakika \u00f6nce al\u0131nmal\u0131d\u0131r.&nbsp;&nbsp;<!--lh-live-editor-->","lh_ezs7je_name":"Yan etkisi var m\u0131?","lh_ezs7je_content_html":"Do\u011fal i\u00e7eriklidir ve genellikle iyi tolere edilir. Ancak lif i\u00e7eri\u011fi y\u00fcksek oldu\u011fundan ilk g\u00fcnlerde gaz\/\u015fi\u015fkinlik olabilir. Su t\u00fcketimini art\u0131rmak bu etkileri azalt\u0131r.&nbsp;&nbsp;<!--lh-live-editor-->","lh_ezxkh5_name":"Kimler kullanmamal\u0131?","lh_ezxkh5_content_html":"Hamileler, emziren anneler ve kronik hastal\u0131\u011f\u0131 olanlar doktor onay\u0131yla kullanmal\u0131d\u0131r. 12 ya\u015f alt\u0131 i\u00e7in \u00f6nerilmez.<!--lh-live-editor-->","lh_f02xew_name":"Glucomannan kilo verdirir mi?","lh_f02xew_content_html":"Glucomannan, suyla birle\u015fti\u011finde mide hacmini doldurarak tokluk hissi yarat\u0131r. Bu da porsiyon kontrol\u00fcn\u00fc kolayla\u015ft\u0131r\u0131r. D\u00fczenli kullan\u0131mda, dengeli beslenme ile birlikte kilo kontrol\u00fcne destek olabilir. Ancak sihirli bir \u00e7\u00f6z\u00fcm de\u011fildir.<!--lh-live-editor-->","lh_f08acn_name":"Zay\u0131flama \u00e7aylar\u0131ndan fark\u0131 ne?","lh_f08acn_content_html":"Zay\u0131flama \u00e7aylar\u0131 genellikle \u00f6dem at\u0131m\u0131 \u00fczerinden ge\u00e7ici etki g\u00f6sterir. Vitacoral Glucomannan ise mide hacmini doldurarak kal\u0131c\u0131 al\u0131\u015fkanl\u0131k de\u011fi\u015fimine odaklan\u0131r. Lif temelli ve bilimsel olarak destekli bir i\u00e7erik yap\u0131s\u0131na sahiptir.<!--lh-live-editor-->","lh_f0dnae_name":"Ger\u00e7ekten i\u015fe yar\u0131yor mu?","lh_f0dnae_content_html":"Avrupa G\u0131da G\u00fcvenli\u011fi Otoritesi (EFSA), Glucomannan\u2019\u0131n kalori kontroll\u00fc diyetle birlikte kilo vermeye katk\u0131 sa\u011flad\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 kabul etmi\u015ftir. D\u00fczenli kullan\u0131m ve beslenme disiplini ile fark edilir sonu\u00e7lar m\u00fcmk\u00fcnd\u00fcr.<!--lh-live-editor-->","lh_f0j085_name":"Ne kadar s\u00fcrede etkisini g\u00f6sterir?","lh_f0j085_content_html":"Ki\u015fiden ki\u015fiye de\u011fi\u015fmekle birlikte, 2\u20134 hafta aras\u0131nda porsiyon kontrol\u00fc ve i\u015ftah y\u00f6netiminde etkiler fark edilebilir. Ancak bu bir \u201cmucize \u00e7\u00f6z\u00fcm\u201d de\u011fil, s\u00fcrd\u00fcr\u00fclebilir bir destek \u00fcr\u00fcn\u00fcd\u00fcr.<!--lh-live-editor-->","lh_f0od5w_name":"\u00d6dem atmaya yard\u0131mc\u0131 olur mu?","lh_f0od5w_content_html":"\u0130\u00e7eri\u011findeki baz\u0131 bile\u015fenler sindirim sistemini destekleyerek dolayl\u0131 olarak \u00f6demin at\u0131lmas\u0131na yard\u0131mc\u0131 olabilir. Ancak temel etki alan\u0131 \u201ci\u015ftah ve porsiyon y\u00f6netimi\u201ddir.<!--lh-live-editor-->","lh_ki54mq_name":"\u0130\u015ftah\u0131 azalt\u0131r m\u0131, nas\u0131l?","lh_ki54mq_content_html":"Glucomannan, suyla birle\u015fince jel k\u0131vam\u0131na gelir ve midenin dolu hissedilmesini sa\u011flar. Bu da do\u011fal olarak daha az yeme ihtiyac\u0131 do\u011furur. Kimyasal bask\u0131 de\u011fil, fiziksel hacim etkisiyle \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r.<!--lh-live-editor-->","lh_kiahkh_name":"Tatl\u0131 krizlerine iyi gelir mi?","lh_kiahkh_content_html":"\u0130\u015ftah\u0131 dengelemesi ve kan \u015fekeri dalgalanmalar\u0131n\u0131 yava\u015flatmas\u0131 sayesinde, \u00f6zellikle \u00f6\u011f\u00fcn \u00f6ncesi kullan\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda tatl\u0131 krizlerini azaltabilir.<!--lh-live-editor-->"},"5lu72svld87":{"lh_a168_title":"S\u0131k\u00e7a Sorulan Sorular (SSS)","lh_ezc4q5_name":"G\u00fcnde ka\u00e7 kez kullanmal\u0131y